'''Two Can''' (キョセーヌ, ''Kyosēnu'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

