==Enemy==
This dual-type enemy has low range and Single Attack but can create an extremely powerful level 2 [[Wave Attack]]. Although Two Can is remarkably frail in comparison to other bulky [[:Category:Wave Attack Enemies|Wave Attackers]], his high damage is beyond compensation, held back only by his long attack animation.

==Strategy==
Two Can's strong waves are not to be taken lightly due to their high reach and can hit much further than himself. However, his Single Attack means all Wave Shields like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] can make him a cakewalk as long as they are protected properly by meatshields, but those that can outrange him will work better if Two Can is accompanied by enemies which can shred lower-ranged Wave Shields. [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave-immune units]] can also serve as decent counters, as they'll simply dismiss the resultant Wave even if he hits.

In the absence of such units, Two Can might be a bit difficult to fight. While [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]]/[[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Dark]] units such as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] and [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] can be used to tank and deal heavy damage thanks to their Strong abilities against his traits (particularly when boosted by [[Cat Combo]]s), Two Can's high damage will overwhelm such units easily if left unchecked. Otherwise, units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Tropical Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Tropical Kalisa]] and [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Yukimura]] can exploit his low health, long attack animation and high knockback count to interrupt his attacks and juggle him, but they must be timed well as other enemies (including more Two Cans, as they will all stand behind the first and hence avoid any attacks meant to hit them) can get in the way. Specialist crowd-controllers like [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], if used well, can disable him easily and create a much larger window of opportunity.

