==Trivia==
*In addition to being a play on ''[[Wikipedia:Toucan|toucan]]'', Two Can's name may refer to how he has two traits and creates level 2 [[Wave Attack]]s.
*Two Can's Japanese name, Kyosēnu (キョセーヌ), is a reference to the late television host [[wikipedia:Kyosen Ōhashi|Kyosen Ōhashi]], whose last name sounds like the Japanese word for toucan. The quiz show in his Japanese description references ''[[wikipedia:ja:クイズダービー|Quiz Derby]]'', which was hosted by Ōhashi.
*Two Can specifically appears to be a [[wikipedia:Toco toucan|toco toucan]], the largest and most common species of toucan.
*Prior to [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]], Two Can's traits in [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]]'s [[Enemy Guide]] were listed as "([[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] / [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Black]])", with a space in front of and behind the slash, rather than "(Red/Black)".

